08130712).jpg"}},{"id":"pattaya_wv_ban_sukhawadee","areaId":"pattaya","name":"Ban Sukhawadee","category":"landmark","tags":["photo"],"location":{"lat":12.98322,"lng":100.91557},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"pattaya_wv_ban_sukhawadee","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.sukhawadee.com/new_web/index.php","official":true}],"signals":{"commonsNearby":0,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-21"},"hashtags":["bansukhawadee","pattaya"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"}]},"summary":"This is the residence of Dr. Panya Chotithewan. Visitors can enter the house to pay respect to the Bodhisattva Kwan Yin, to see the spacious conference room and the roof.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"Pattaya"},{"id":"pattaya_wv_boyz_town","areaId":"pattaya","name":"Boyz Town","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":12.92733,"lng":100.87629},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"pattaya_wv_boyz_town","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["boyztown","pattaya"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"Features only male dancers and bars that cater for the gay crowd; Soi Pattayaland 1 (Soi 13/3) has even more all-male go-gos (eight), but does have a couple of girl-go-go bars as well. Pattayaland 1 is relatively dead in the daytime, but Pattayaland 3 has a handful of places to eat and drink that keep it ticking over in the afternoon. There is also a small lesbian scene in Pattaya, with local butc","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Pattaya"},{"id":"pattaya_wv_pattayaland","areaId":"pattaya","name":"Pattayaland","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":12.928,"lng":100.8762},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"pattaya_wv_pattayaland","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["pattayaland","pattaya"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"Soi Pattayaland 2 (Soi 13/4) features on many Pattaya postcards—when lit up at night, the go-go bar signs are a memorable and photogenic sight, although there are only eight go-go bars here (two of which feature guys, not girls), plus a half-dozen bars and the Penthouse Hotel. Worth a look in the evening (it's almost a ghost town the rest of the time), but get there before 01:00 as that's when the","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Pattaya"},{"id":"pattaya_wv_second_road_soi_2_soi_3_junctions","areaId":"pattaya","name":"Second Road, Soi 2 & Soi 3 Junctions","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":12.94575,"lng":100.88873},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"pattaya_wv_second_road_soi_2_soi_3_junctions","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["secondroadsoi2soi3junctions","pattaya"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"A collection of about 35 very popular beer bars, which start to fill up from about 16:00, and several of which remain open long after the lights go out around 01:00-02:00. \"Atlantic Bar\", at the far end of the five-bar strip to the south of Soi 2, always draws a substantial crowd. The only go-go (\"Classroom 2\", 19:30-02:00) is a lively one, and while there's not much in the way of food in amid the","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Pattaya"},{"id":"pattaya_wv_soi_7_and_soi_8","areaId":"pattaya","name":"Soi 7 and Soi 8","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":12.93633,"lng":100.88481},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"pattaya_wv_soi_7_and_soi_8","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["soi7andsoi8","pattaya"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"There's always something going on here—in the evening and early hours, there are about 120 well-staffed beer bars to choose from, plus a handful of go-go bars; in the morning there are several places that serve breakfast; in the afternoon it's a popular place for those who like to get started early; and at Songkran (Thai New Year) it's unmitigated mayhem. There are several large hotels (light slee","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Pattaya"},{"id":"pattaya_wv_soi_yodsak","areaId":"pattaya","name":"Soi Yodsak","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":12.94232,"lng":100.88637},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"pattaya_wv_soi_yodsak","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["soiyodsak","pattaya"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"Imagine a kerb-crawlers paradise—and then pedestrianise it. Arguably Pattaya's most colourful street (as well as the most notorious one), Soi 6 has about 50 bars (mostly \"short time\" bars, with names such as \"Butterfly\", \"Love Club\", \"Route 69\" and \"The Eager Beaver\") which all get going at 13:00 and close pretty much on the dot at 01:00. It's not really a pedestrian-only street (but it is one-way","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Pattaya"},{"id":"pattaya_wv_trattoria_pizzeria_toscana_moom_talay_thai_resta","areaId":"pattaya","name":"Trattoria Pizzeria Toscana-Moom Talay Thai Restaurant","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":12.9422,"lng":100.88494},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"pattaya_wv_trattoria_pizzeria_toscana_moom_talay_thai_resta","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.facebook.com/toscanapattayabeach/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["trattoriapizzeriatoscanamoomtalaythairestaurant","pattaya"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"An unusual combination: an Italian restaurant coupled with a Thai restaurant. The place is huge, with the two restaurants occupying different sections, but sharing menus. Large outside seating area. The restaurant bakes its own bread, makes its own pasta, and sells meat that it raises on its own farm. The ambience is great, with historical photos of Tuscany and hand-painted Italian crockery on the","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Pattaya"},{"id":"pattaya_wv_baywatch_restaurant","areaId":"pattaya","name":"Baywatch Restaurant","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":12.92855,"lng":100.87609},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"pattaya_wv_baywatch_restaurant","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["baywatchrestaurant","pattaya"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Don't let its unassuming appearance fool you. This hole-in-the-wall has great food. The American breakfast is a great deal. Bacon, eggs, taters, toast, coffee, and fresh squeezed juice. Their cheeseburgers are beyond anything. On the other side, asking for anything special or substitutions like \"can I have rice instead of potatoes?\" will met with a curt \"no!\". Still delicious.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Pattaya"},{"id":"pattaya_wv_nangnual_restaurant","areaId":"pattaya","name":"Nangnual Restaurant","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":12.92542,"lng":100.87091},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"pattaya_wv_nangnual_restaurant","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.facebook.com/NangnualSeafood/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["nangnualrestaurant","pattaya"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"In business since 1965, this is a super restaurant on the water in an unlikely Walking Street location. Seafood is a speciality, but the menu has sections devoted to Western food, Thai food, Italian food, Chinese food, and Japanese food. Extensive wine cellar. Attentive, friendly staff and reasonable prices.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Pattaya"},{"id":"pattaya_wv_kiss_food_drinks_2_second_road","areaId":"pattaya","name":"Kiss Food & Drinks 2 Second Road","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":12.931,"lng":100.88203},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"pattaya_wv_kiss_food_drinks_2_second_road","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["kissfooddrinks2secondroad","pattaya"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"It serves cheap and cheerful Thai and Western favourites 24/7 at two semi-open-air locations - one on Second Rd opposite Mike Shopping Mall, the other in Naklua Road just past Boncafe - also in Jomtien and Soi Pornprapanimit (Soi Siam Country Club)","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Pattaya"},{"id":"pattaya_wv_big_c_extra_food_court","areaId":"pattaya","name":"Big C Extra Food Court","category":"food","tags":["food","markets"],"location":{"lat":12.93512,"lng":100.89465},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"pattaya_wv_big_c_extra_food_court","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["bigcextrafoodcourt","pattaya"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Temporarily closed as of May 2022. It has good food including cheap Isaan treats, such as som tam (papaya salad) and khao neow (sticky rice). The Big C Extra stand, usually near the parking garage entrance, has inexpensive sandwiches.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Pattaya"},{"id":"pattaya_wv_king_kebab","areaId":"pattaya","name":"King Kebab","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":12.92572,"lng":100.87181},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"pattaya_wv_king_kebab","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["kingkebab","pattaya"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Perfect for eating kebabs. It's good for a quick bite to eat on the go. Kebab really good served in this little place. The owner is very courteous, the prompt service. Good before clubbing and afterwards.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Pattaya"},{"id":"pattaya_wv_fra_pattaya","areaId":"pattaya","name":"Fra Pattaya","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":12.92689,"lng":100.87533},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"pattaya_wv_fra_pattaya","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["frapattaya","pattaya"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Unassuming setting yet absolutely excellent food. Good place for Thai food. Completely local. It's like market area ambience. A real Sino Thai restaurant where you can enjoy a lacquered duck.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Pattaya"}],"sources":["Wikidata (CC0)","Wikimedia Commons (counts; photos credited per file)","Wikipedia (pageviews; summaries CC BY-SA 4.0)","Wikivoyage (listings: hours, prices, descriptions; CC BY-SA 4.0)","OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL): opening hours, fees, websites"]}